97, "text": "busier", "start": 113.494, "end": 113.934}, {"i": 298, "text": "as", "start": 114.094, "end": 114.154}, {"i": 299, "text": "well.", "start": 114.234, "end": 114.474}, {"i": 300, "text": "They", "start": 115.082, "end": 115.203}, {"i": 301, "text": "have.", "start": 115.263, "end": 115.584}, {"i": 302, "text": "The", "start": 115.905, "end": 116.005}, {"i": 303, "text": "whole", "start": 116.025, "end": 116.206}, {"i": 304, "text": "town", "start": 116.246, "end": 116.487}, {"i": 305, "text": "seems", "start": 116.527, "end": 116.767}, {"i": 306, "text": "full", "start": 116.828, "end": 117.008}, {"i": 307, "text": "at", "start": 117.048, "end": 117.109}, {"i": 308, "text": "the", "start": 117.129, "end": 117.229}, {"i": 309, "text": "moment.", "start": 117.249, "end": 117.55}, {"i": 310, "text": "Take", "start": 118.212, "end": 118.413}, {"i": 311, "text": "care,", "start": 118.473, "end": 118.694}, {"i": 312, "text": "Kirsten.", "start": 118.754, "end": 119.235}, {"i": 313, "text": "Thank", "start": 119.757, "end": 119.958}, {"i": 314, "text": "you,", "start": 119.978, "end": 120.078}, {"i": 315, "text": "Dr.", "start": 120.118, "end": 120.359}, {"i": 316, "text": "Bruhn.", "start": 120.379, "end": 120.6}], "segments": [{"start": 0.066, "end": 0.927, "text": "Hello, Kirsten."}, {"start": 1.207, "end": 2.448, "text": "Come in and sit down."}, {"start": 3.009, "end": 3.449, "text": "Thank you."}, {"start": 4.21, "end": 7.012, "text": "I have been a little nervous about today, I will admit."}, {"start": 7.733, "end": 10.555, "text": "Let us take it in order, and it will make more sense."}, {"start": 11.196, "end": 12.757, "text": "You came about tiredness."}, {"start": 13.297, "end": 15.479, "text": "Yes, it has been going on and on."}, {"start": 15.82, "end": 17.101, "text": "It simply does not lift."}, {"start": 17.741, "end": 19.022, "text": "Persistent fatigue."}, {"start": 19.503, "end": 21.284, "text": "That is what we were investigating."}, {"start": 21.725, "end": 22.705, "text": "That is it exactly."}, {"start": 23.406, "end": 25.588, "text": "And I keep thinking there must be a reason for it."}, {"start": 26.289, "end": 27.85, "text": "We tested two things."}, {"start": 28.382, "end": 32.603, "text": "The first was your thyroid-stimulating hormone, the thyroid."}, {"start": 33.123, "end": 34.264, "text": "I had wondered about that one."}, {"start": 34.924, "end": 35.984, "text": "It came back normal."}, {"start": 36.524, "end": 36.924, "text": "Normal."}, {"start": 37.685, "end": 38.305, "text": "And the other one?"}, {"start": 38.965, "end": 41.186, "text": "Your glucose, which is your blood sugar."}, {"start": 41.766, "end": 43.106, "text": "That was normal as well."}, {"start": 43.766, "end": 44.447, "text": "Both normal."}, {"start": 45.127, "end": 46.307, "text": "So nothing was found at all."}, {"start": 46.987, "end": 47.467, "text": "Correct."}, {"start": 48.108, "end": 52.409, "text": "My assessment is that there is no hormonal cause for the tiredness."}, {"start": 53.029, "end": 54.069, "text": "No hormonal cause."}, {"start": 54.669, "end": 56.49, "text": "Does that mean nothing serious is going on?"}, {"start": 57.222, "end": 60.745, "text": "It tells us the thyroid and the glucose results are normal."}, {"start": 61.385, "end": 63.387, "text": "That is what these tests can say."}, {"start": 63.988, "end": 64.328, "text": "I see."}, {"start": 64.968, "end": 67.731, "text": "But I am still tired, so something must be causing it."}, {"start": 68.571, "end": 70.433, "text": "I understand that is frustrating."}, {"start": 71.013, "end": 74.336, "text": "What the tests show is that these results are normal."}, {"start": 74.876, "end": 75.137, "text": "Right."}, {"start": 75.757, "end": 76.738, "text": "So what is the plan then?"}, {"start": 77.519, "end": 81.282, "text": "No specific treatment is needed on the basis of these results."}, {"start": 81.902, "end": 82.523, "text": "Nothing at all?"}, {"start": 83.263, "end": 85.225, "text": "That feels strange when I still feel like this."}, {"start": 86.026, "end": 86.346, "text": "I know."}, {"start": 86.886, "end": 89.787, "text": "That is the plan today, based on what we have found."}, {"start": 90.407, "end": 91.287, "text": "Does that make sense?"}, {"start": 91.907, "end": 92.508, "text": "I think so."}, {"start": 93.188, "end": 95.168, "text": "It is just not what I had expected to hear."}, {"start": 95.929, "end": 98.029, "text": "That is completely understandable."}, {"start": 98.649, "end": 98.99, "text": "Sorry."}, {"start": 99.61, "end": 102.13, "text": "I have been dwelling on it rather a lot since the tests."}, {"start": 102.571, "end": 103.151, "text": "Not at all."}, {"start": 103.711, "end": 107.112, "text": "The seasons are turning now, which everybody seems to be noticing."}, {"start": 107.852, "end": 108.332, "text": "They are."}, {"start": 108.672, "end": 110.713, "text": "It is getting dark so much earlier already."}, {"start": 111.273, "end": 114.474, "text": "And the school holidays have made everything busier as well."}, {"start": 115.082, "end": 115.584, "text": "They have."}, {"start": 115.905, "end": 117.55, "text": "The whole town seems full at the moment."}, {"start": 118.212, "end": 119.235, "text": "Take care, Kirsten."}, {"start": 119.757, "end": 120.6, "text": "Thank you, Dr. Bruhn."}], "machine": "gpu59.int.triton.aalto.fi", "git_commit": "735eed3a1a4f5d8bc8a3ac1f1c8897e291443b9f", "date": "2026-09-20", "timing_s": {"transcribe_and_align": 2.236}}